# Project Rules

This project is an AI-assisted development environment using Cursor and AI agents.

All code must follow these principles.

---

# Tech Stack

Language:

TypeScript only.

Frameworks:

React
Node.js

CSS:

Less or standard CSS only.

Do not use Tailwind.

---

# Code Quality

Code must be:

- strongly typed
- modular
- readable
- well structured

Avoid:

````

any
large files
deep nesting

```

Prefer:

```

pure functions
small modules
clear naming

```

---

# File Size Guidelines

Files should generally stay under:

```

300 lines

```

If larger, split into modules.

---

# Naming Conventions

Variables:

```

camelCase

```

Components:

```

PascalCase

```

Constants:

```

UPPER_CASE

```

---

# React Rules

Use:

```

functional components
hooks

```

Avoid:

```

class components

```

---

# Error Handling

Always handle failures:

```

DOM capture failures
storage failures
MCP network errors

```

---

# AI Agent Behavior

If a recurring problem appears:

Add documentation.

If architecture changes:

Update:

```

ARCHITECTURE.md

```